this repository:

- Wikipedia (Wikimedia Foundation): article summaries for the Wikipedia lookup.
- MyMemory (Translated, https://mymemory.translated.net): translations for the translation lookup, through its
  keyless API. Each result is shown with the credit "MyMemory".
- LibreTranslate (https://libretranslate.com): only a server the user sets up
  and names in the settings is asked.

